        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="translated">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>How can I help you, Corporal?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чим я можу вам допомогти, Корпорале?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I have eyes - everywhere!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У мене очі – всюди!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Maybe I'm spending too much time staring at a monitor... Nah!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Можливо, я занадто багато часу проводжу, дивлячись на монітор... Ні!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Sometimes when I'm *really* bored, I watch the Arena.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Іноді, коли мені *дуже* нудно, я дивлюсь Арену.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I even have cameras in the toilet! ::Laughs.:: Just kidding! It's all clear. It's all... clear.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У мене навіть камери в туалеті! ::Сміється.:: Це жарт! Все чисто. Все... чисто.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Is-- is that a dead pixel?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Це-- це мертвий піксель?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
